                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "30800908",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561198376107393",
                            "num_reviews": 3,
                            "playtime_forever": 183,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 183,
                            "last_played": 1492071866
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "So... I just finished the game. Let's get to positive and negative parts of this game.\n\nPositive:\n- Ending. I guess it is the best part of the game. I don't want to spoil you this part, so all I can tell you... I really feel myself Manipulated, and that is awesome :)\n- Puzzles. Some of them easy, but most of them are really good and interesting. Almost all of them are unique. And there are a lot of them, that is good. I like it.\n\nBetween Positive and Negative:\n- Action. I guess this part would be completely Positive if bosses fight would be more epic. But still it's not bad.\n\nNegative:\n- Around 3hr and I done with this game. I want more :)\n\nSo I would recommend this game everyone who like puzzles and unpredictable endings. You guys can't miss this game. If you hate puzzles and you just want to shoot robots I guess this game not for you.",
